('description', "Do you want to help us build a sustainable future but you did not find the right vacancy for you? We still want to hear from you! We are always looking for people to add to our team so please send your resume and a motivation letter.

**What we offer**

*   A self-starting job based in Rotterdam;
*   A dynamic and changing environment with (future) possibilities for international assignments;
*   Career development program (eg. internal mentoring program and business challenges in your first year);
*   An informal and open culture where you can explore your competencies.

Blue Phoenix offers the perfect environment to have impact. We offer you a career and not just a job. We'll provide you with a safe and friendly working environment, tools and support for your career and personal development. We value talents with different backgrounds, who want to be part of something bigger. At Blue Phoenix we are building a sustainable future.

Blue Phoenix recovers minerals and ferrous and non-ferrous metals from Incinerator Bottom Ash (IBA) into high-quality products, contributing to the circular economy by closing the recycling loop.")
